       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LINAGEP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT P ASSIGN TO DD1.
           SELECT Q ASSIGN TO DD2.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  P LINAGE IS 5 LINES WITH FOOTING AT 4
               LINES AT TOP 1 LINES AT BOTTOM 2.
       01  P-REC PIC X(4).
       FD  Q LINAGE QL.
       01  Q-REC PIC X(4).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  QL PIC 99 VALUE 3.
       77  N PIC 9 VALUE 2.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           WRITE P-REC BEFORE ADVANCING N LINES
               AT END-OF-PAGE DISPLAY "E"
               NOT AT EOP DISPLAY "N" END-WRITE.
           WRITE Q-REC AFTER PAGE.
           DISPLAY LINAGE-COUNTER OF P.
           GOBACK.
